From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DeepSeek Harness <noreply@deepseek.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 16:03:21 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Make a drag on a file row or tile move the files and a
 blank-space drag choose what its box crosses, since MyGo's DragSelect only
 chose rows pressed on and dragged files were wrongly multi-selected.

---
 AGENTS.md            |   2 +-
 CHANGELOG.md         |   2 +
 CLAUDE.md            |   2 +-
 README.md            |   2 +-
 app/app_test.go      |  27 ++-
 app/browser.go       | 510 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---------
 app/dragmove_test.go | 268 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 app/files.go         |  60 +++--
 app/grid.go          |   4 -
 app/marquee_test.go  | 101 +++++----
 10 files changed, 791 insertions(+), 187 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 app/dragmove_test.go

diff --git a/AGENTS.md b/AGENTS.md
index 6dd4e2e..944c51f 100644
--- a/AGENTS.md
+++ b/AGENTS.md
@@ -95,4 +95,4 @@ Entering the page reads the cache again only when it is entered (`dedupEnter` no
 - `Painter.AnimationFrame` (and `After`) only paints the window again: the view is not built, so anything computed while building (an element's size, an effect's uniforms, state moved on in `View`) stands still in those frames. Read the time as you paint (`p.Now()` in a `Draw` callback, or in an effect's `PaintEffect`, as `specksFx` does), and call `c.Invalidate()` while something built must move (`a.moving()`). Stamp an animation's start in the first frame that shows it, not from the last frame built, which may be long past.
 - Files come and go through specks (`app/arrivals.go`): a deleted file stays in its listing while it dissolves (`a.dying`, kept through reloads by `keepDying`), and an upload shows in its folder at once as a row with a negative FsID that gathers as its bytes go up (`a.gathers`, by the path of the entry it makes); rows with a negative FsID or dissolving are never chosen or opened.
 - Sidebar icons are drawn in code (`app/navicons.go`) so their parts can move; `navGlyph` takes the time into the gesture. A page's icon plays once when the page opens (`a.navRun`).
-- The browser's rubber-band selection (`marquee` in `app/browser.go`): pressing the primary button in the list or grid and dragging paints a rounded rectangle from the press point to the pointer with `page.DrawOver` — a faint `t.Accent.Alpha(0.12)` fill and a 1px `t.Accent` stroke — clipped to the list's or grid's viewport (`l.dragArea`). The press comes from the page's `ObserveInput`, so a drag begun in a row's blank space counts too and the box ends on the release; the list's rows are still chosen by MyGo's `ListState.DragSelecting` (`DragSelect`), which the rectangle only mirrors, while the grid chooses the tiles whose `gridSpot.rect` the rectangle intersects. It is hidden while the preview, a dialog, an in-place rename or the folder maker has the pointer, and while files from another app are dragged in (`l.over`).
+- The browser's pointer gestures (`marquee` and the move drag in `app/browser.go`): the page's `ObserveInput` (the capture phase) sees every pointer press, move and release in it, in window coordinates (`page.PointerPosition` plus the page's box). A press on a row or a grid tile — `l.rowRects`, filled each frame with each list row's `Bounds`, and `gridSpot.rect` — begins a move drag once the pointer goes `marqueeSlop` DIPs: it drags the whole choice when the pressed item is one of it, else it chooses just that item and drags it (a plain click still chooses by MyGo's `ListState`). While dragging, `page.DrawOver` paints a translucent card that follows the pointer (icon + name, or "N 项") and lights the folder under it (`l.moveTarget`/`l.moveTargetRect`: a folder row, a folder tile, or a breadcrumb from `l.crumbRects`); the release moves the files with `moveOrCopyAfter`, refusing the same folder, the folder itself and its own subfolders, and asking `place` about clashing names, while a release on blank space or off the window cancels. A press on the list's or grid's blank space instead paints the rubber band — a faint `t.Accent.Alpha(0.12)` fill and a 1px `t.Accent` stroke, rounded, clipped to `l.dragArea` — and chooses the rows (`l.rowRects`) or tiles (`gridSpot.rect`) it intersects, replacing the choice or, with Cmd held at the press, adding to it (`l.dragBase`); MyGo's `ListState.DragSelect` is off. A release over the title bar is not under the page, so `filesToolbar`'s own `ObserveInput` ends a drag dropped on a breadcrumb or let go over the tools, and a canceled or fresh press clears any leftover state. Both gestures are hidden while the preview, a dialog, an in-place rename or the folder maker has the pointer, and while files from another app are dragged in (`l.over`).
diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 9f12605..3f105fb 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -14,11 +14,13 @@
 
 ### 改进
 
+- 新增「拖动即移动」：在列表或网格中按住文件 / 文件夹拖动并放到另一个文件夹行、文件夹瓦片或面包屑上即可移动过去，拖动时跟随指针显示半透明卡片（多项显示「N 项」），可投放的目标会高亮；拖到空白处或窗口外取消，同名交给冲突对话框，拖进自身或其子目录会被拒绝。左键拖动项目不再多选。
 - 文件夹页的路径栏新增一条工具栏，把新建文件夹、排序、视图切换、从剪贴板打开分享链接、刷新与上传放在路径与搜索之后；窗口变窄时除上传外都收成带提示的图标，路径不够时先折工具栏。列表底部不再重复新建文件夹与上传两个按钮，拖拽时整行提示投放位置、不拖拽时不占高度；网格最后一格改为整块「新建」磁贴，点击即新建文件夹；空文件夹保留「这里还空着」并只给一个专属的上传入口，避免与工具栏按钮同名；新建文件夹的飞入动画改从工具栏按钮出发。
 - 查重结果会缓存到用户数据目录（`dedup.json`，默认 7 天内有效）：网盘文件没有变动时，再次进入查重页立即显示上次结果，不再整盘重扫；删除、移动 / 复制、重命名、新建文件夹、还原或清空回收站、上传完成、离线下载完成等改动会记一次变更，使缓存失效并在进入页面时自动重扫；扫描期间有改动则不写缓存，并在页头提示重新扫描。
 
 ### 修复
 
+- 修复选择框只能看不能选：从列表或网格空白处拖出的框现在会真正选中与矩形相交的行（此前依赖 MyGo 的 DragSelect，只在按下落在行上时才选，空白起框选不中任何行）与瓦片；默认替换选择，按住 ⌘ 拖框则追加。
 - 不再在窗口获得焦点或登录时自动读取剪贴板，避免剪贴板所有者无响应时 GTK 的同步读取卡住主线程；分享链接改由文件工具栏的链接按钮或 Cmd-V 显式读取。
 - 上传大量小文件时，合并同一目录的完成刷新（约 500 毫秒内一次）与后台完成通知（2 秒内合成一条），并停止空闲时每秒重绘图表和失焦窗口的定时目录刷新，减少界面无响应。
 
